WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.600 --> 00:00:03.630
Building a website shouldn't feel like a second job.

2
00:00:04.800 --> 00:00:06.420
With us, it doesn't.

3
00:00:08.100 --> 00:00:11.990
Here's how we build it around your business, in five clear steps.

4
00:00:12.700 --> 00:00:15.160
First, onboard. You tell us once.

5
00:00:15.400 --> 00:00:20.960
We come prepared to one thirty minute call, with a clear plan we recommend for your business.

6
00:00:20.840 --> 00:00:22.300
You just say yes.

7
00:00:25.100 --> 00:00:27.380
Then, prep. You see it take shape.

8
00:00:27.350 --> 00:00:31.560
We design a theme made just for you: your colours and typography.

9
00:00:31.450 --> 00:00:35.590
Then we plan every page, and write every word for your customers.

10
00:00:35.450 --> 00:00:37.820
Nothing is built until you agree.

11
00:00:37.900 --> 00:00:39.800
Build. You steer, we build.

12
00:00:40.600 --> 00:00:45.700
Watch it come to life on a live preview link, with a short call at each milestone.

13
00:00:45.600 --> 00:00:49.930
Want a change? Unlimited changes, across three review rounds.

14
00:00:50.700 --> 00:00:54.160
Launch. Tested on every screen, and set up for search.

15
00:00:54.510 --> 00:00:57.000
Then, with your final yes, you're live.

16
00:01:01.500 --> 00:01:04.060
Handover. You get back to your business.

17
00:01:04.200 --> 00:01:08.020
We train your team, and hand you full ownership, with a written guide.

18
00:01:08.200 --> 00:01:12.550
And our care plan keeps it fast and secure, as your business grows.

19
00:01:13.300 --> 00:01:15.200
Built right. Built fast.

20
00:01:15.700 --> 00:01:19.160
Book a call, and talk to us in as little as thirty minutes.
